 you can properly site your source the logical assumption is that you were mistaken.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Going by Willow now, or Wil for short. She/Her/Hers.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/269-charlaquin","name":"Charlaquin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar269_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10831"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-22T00:32:42-07:00","id":176807,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Charlaquin</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/124026-idigam-chronicles-weekly-discussion-shapeshifting?p=176801#post176801\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">This comment made me curious, so I went back and read every one of Stew's comments on the shapeshifting preview blog. He never said anything about Gauru armor in those comments, so unless you can properly site your source the logical assumption is that you were mistaken.</div> </div> </div> </div>W/E. Guess Silver rounds get embedded into their armor and just do bashing or lethal.<br /> <br /> Not really in the mood to look it up.<br /> <br /> I can swear I saw it, somewhere, and it makes perfect sense.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/576-ephsy","name":"Ephsy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar576_2.png","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2615"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-22T00:40:13-07:00","id":176809,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ephsy</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/124026-idigam-chronicles-weekly-discussion-shapeshifting?p=176807#post176807\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> W/E. Guess Silver rounds get embedded into their armor and just do bashing or lethal.<br /> <br /> Not really in the mood to look it up.<br /> <br /> I can swear I saw it, somewhere, and it makes perfect sense.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Find it or it didn't happen. I readied the comments under the Shapeshifting article and also couldn't found. Maybe <b>Bunyip</b> or <b>Acrozatarim </b>can help us on this problem - are Uratha in <b>Indigam Chronicle</b> having 1/1 Armor in Gauru?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-22T00:41:40-07:00","id":176810,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ephsy</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/124026-idigam-chronicles-weekly-discussion-shapeshifting?p=176807#post176807\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"> W/E. Guess Silver rounds get embedded into their armor and just do bashing or lethal. Not really in the mood to look it up. I can swear I saw it, somewhere, and it makes perfect sense.</div> </div> </div> </div> I don't disagree, especially with the insane amount of healing Gauru have now. Seems crazy to not only need to do Agg, but also do at least 2 points of it to have any lasting effect at all, or 3 if you're using firearms. So I would assume it's no longer a part of the form as well, but there's not really any evidence to support that assumption as far as I've found.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Going by Willow now, or Wil for short. She/Her/Hers.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/269-charlaquin","name":"Charlaquin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar269_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10831"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-22T00:58:25-07:00","id":176815,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Charlaquin</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/124026-idigam-chronicles-weekly-discussion-shapeshifting?p=176810#post176810\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"> I don't disagree, especially with the insane amount of healing Gauru have now. Seems crazy to not only need to do Agg, but also do at least 2 points of it to have any lasting effect at all, or 3 if you're using firearms. So I would assume it's no longer a part of the form as well, but there's not really any evidence to support that assumption as far as I've found.</div> </div> </div> </div>Other than bludgeoning common sense.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/576-ephsy","name":"Ephsy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar576_2.png","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2615"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-22T01:55:28-07:00","id":176845,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wyrdhamster</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/124026-idigam-chronicles-weekly-discussion-shapeshifting?p=176809#post176809\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> Find it or it didn't happen. I readied the comments under the Shapeshifting article and also couldn't found. Maybe <b>Bunyip</b> or <b>Acrozatarim </b>can help us on this problem - are Uratha in <b>Indigam Chronicle</b> having 1/1 Armor in Gauru?</div> </div> </div> </div>Stew's covered what benefits and drawbacks Gauru has in his development blog <a href=\"http://theonyxpath.com/the-changing-man/\" target=\"_blank\">http://theonyxpath.com/the-changing-man/</a>. Since 1/1 Armor is <u>not</u> included, I would say it is a fair assumption that Gauru does not have Armor.<br /> <br /> Ephsy's comment about common sense also applies. With dodge vs firearms and full regeneration each turn, armor would (IMO) be overkill.<br /> <br /> Wyrdhamster, if you're going to playtest the changes, assume that what Stew posts are wholesale changes unless he says this is in addition to what already exists. The detail given for Forms, Gifts, Rites, Harmony etc. are complete changes from how WtF works at the moment. Though you don't have enough details to substitute some parts entirely, with forms you probably do.<br /> <br /> Stew's blogs tend to cover the detail rather well. Also, everything in the first drafts is subject to playtest, so anything Stew (or Acrozatarim, or I) posts could change before publication.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Writer. Developer.</i> <b>World of Darkness</b> | <b>Chronicles of Darkness</b> | <b>The Trinity Continuum</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/156-bunyip","name":"Bunyip","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar156_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1880"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}